          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "caterer",
          "duration_sec": 8,
          "transcript": "[hesitant whisper] \"Hi {{player_name}}, this is Marco from Briarwood Venue. Before you cancel—do you know the groom booked THIS exact ballroom under another bride’s name six months ago?\"",
